WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.610
From your home to school,

2
00:00:01.610 --> 00:00:03.470
there are many ways to go.

3
00:00:04.090 --> 00:00:07.470
Some roads are long, some are short, and

4
00:00:07.470 --> 00:00:09.270
one bridge floods when it rains.

5
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.100
Which way is the shortest?

6
00:00:12.590 --> 00:00:14.390
Today: find the shortest

7
00:00:14.390 --> 00:00:16.170
way, step by step.

8
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:19.880
On a map, each road has a number:

9
00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:22.060
how many kilometres long it is.

10
00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:24.660
To find how long a way is,

11
00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:26.180
add up its roads.

12
00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:27.900
The way with the smallest

13
00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:29.460
total is the shortest.

14
00:00:30.890 --> 00:00:32.410
The way through Bora looks

15
00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:34.850
straight: five and ten make fifteen.

16
00:00:35.630 --> 00:00:37.770
The way through Tala, Kesi and

17
00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:40.950
Mina has more bends: four, three,

18
00:00:41.450 --> 00:00:44.110
two and four make thirteen.

19
00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:46.060
Thirteen is shorter!

20
00:00:47.420 --> 00:00:49.460
Here’s a trick that always works.

21
00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:52.480
Give each place a number: the

22
00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:54.280
shortest way you’ve found so far.

23
00:00:54.880 --> 00:00:56.820
Each turn, settle the waiting

24
00:00:56.820 --> 00:00:58.660
place with the smallest number.

25
00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:01.500
Then look at its roads, and give its

26
00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:03.320
neighbours smaller numbers if you can.

27
00:01:04.550 --> 00:01:05.010
Quick check!

28
00:01:05.670 --> 00:01:08.830
Bora has five, and Rubi has six.

29
00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:11.200
Which one do you settle first?

30
00:01:12.560 --> 00:01:15.860
Bora, because five is smaller than six.

31
00:01:16.610 --> 00:01:18.150
Nothing can make Bora

32
00:01:18.150 --> 00:01:19.890
closer than five now.

33
00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:22.150
Keep going until the school is

34
00:01:22.150 --> 00:01:23.750
settled: thirteen kilometres.

35
00:01:25.360 --> 00:01:27.400
After heavy rain, the bridge

36
00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:29.480
between Kesi and Mina is closed.

37
00:01:30.260 --> 00:01:33.140
Start again from home with the same trick.

38
00:01:33.620 --> 00:01:36.120
Now the shortest way goes through Rubi

39
00:01:36.120 --> 00:01:38.040
and Sana: fourteen kilometres.

40
00:01:39.560 --> 00:01:41.260
Robots and map apps find

41
00:01:41.260 --> 00:01:42.300
shortest ways too.

42
00:01:42.910 --> 00:01:45.410
A robot on a grid counts squares,

43
00:01:45.830 --> 00:01:47.430
and walls block its path.

44
00:01:48.100 --> 00:01:50.520
The fewest moves is its shortest way.

45
00:01:51.710 --> 00:01:53.610
Some children walk much farther

46
00:01:53.610 --> 00:01:54.770
to school than others.

47
00:01:55.560 --> 00:01:57.980
When grown-ups plan a new road or bridge,

48
00:01:57.980 --> 00:02:00.700
they can ask: who walks the farthest?

49
00:02:01.370 --> 00:02:03.210
A fair plan helps them too.

50
00:02:04.470 --> 00:02:07.830
In the app, tap Home, then always tap the

51
00:02:07.830 --> 00:02:09.690
waiting village with the smallest number.

52
00:02:10.330 --> 00:02:11.970
When the school is settled, the

53
00:02:11.970 --> 00:02:13.470
shortest way lights up.

54
00:02:14.060 --> 00:02:16.600
Then flood the bridge, and try again.

55
00:02:17.790 --> 00:02:18.290
Your turn.

56
00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:19.960
The bridge is flooded.

57
00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:22.500
Which way is the shortest now?

58
00:02:23.670 --> 00:02:24.730
Through Rubi and Sana:

59
00:02:25.290 --> 00:02:26.430
fourteen kilometres.

60
00:02:27.260 --> 00:02:29.220
Remember: add up the roads.

61
00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.880
Settle the smallest number first.

62
00:02:32.670 --> 00:02:35.290
And when a road closes, find a new way.

63
00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:38.960
Try it yourself: draw a map of your

64
00:02:38.960 --> 00:02:40.740
way to school or to the market,

65
00:02:41.020 --> 00:02:42.920
with a number on each road.

66
00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:45.820
Find the shortest way with the trick.

67
00:02:46.380 --> 00:02:49.520
Then close one road, and find the new way.
